Package: gemmaR
Title: Score Affect from Text Using Local Gemma 3
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Garrett", "Baber", , "garrett.baber@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8467-7726"))
Description: Provides functions to rate affect dimensions from text using Gemma 3
    (12B) running locally via Ollama or LM Studio. Supports Positive/Negative
    Affect, the Circumplex Model (Valence and Arousal), and the 20-item Positive
    and Negative Affect Schedule (PANAS; Watson et al., 1988).
